      "workings": "The draft is two lines: svc-cons 50000 x 1 = 50000 and svc-lab 20000 x 2 = 40000, so billGrossPaise = 90000. The coupon's minimum bill is 85000 and 90000 >= 85000, so it applies. THREE numbers it is deliberately NOT compared against: this line's own gross 50000 (under the threshold), the other line's gross 40000 (under it), and the post-contest total 43000 + 36000 = 79000 (also under it) - the threshold is measured on the GROSS bill, before any instrument or rule takes anything off. On L1: the camp rule needs tag camp2026 which IS present and is unscoped, so percentAmount(50000, 1000) = divHalfUp(50000000, 10000) = floor((100000000 + 10000)/20000) = floor(5000.5) = 5000; the coupon is flat 7000 scoped to consultation, so min(7000, 50000) = 7000. 7000 > 5000, the coupon wins on value. taxableBase 50000 - 7000 = 43000; consultation is exempt so cgst and sgst are 0 and net is 43000.",
