      "workings": "L2 is svc-lab 20000 x 2 = gross 40000. The coupon's scope is the consultation category only, so benefitCoversLine is false for a lab line and the coupon proposes nothing here even though it qualified on the bill - a scope is per line, a threshold is per bill, and the two are separate tests. The camp rule is unscoped and applies: percentAmount(40000, 1000) = divHalfUp(40000000, 10000) = floor((80000000 + 10000)/20000) = floor(4000.5) = 4000. taxableBase 40000 - 4000 = 36000. lab is NOT exempt at 1800bps: taxHead(36000, 1800) = divHalfUp(36000*1800, 20000) = divHalfUp(64800000, 20000) = floor((129600000 + 20000)/40000) = floor(3240.5) = 3240 per head, so net = 36000 + 3240 + 3240 = 42480.",
